WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.670
Both of you...

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.670
If I asked you for details,
I have a feeling it would get confusing,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.250
so just answer with a yes or no.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.010
Are you two dating?

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:09.960
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.220
Okay, then...
You really like each other?

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:13.970
- No.
- No.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.010
I can't understand
if you just answer yes or no!

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:57.950
HOWL AT TOMORROW

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.910
My mom just went crazy.
Dating sure is tough.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.990
Oh, come on, it's not
tough on you, Miyakoshi.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:03.790
You just get treated all the time.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.250
Have you talked to your parents
about it, Higashida?

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.120
My parents don't interfere.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:13.050
Although it seems
my little sister told them about it.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:19.890
HANAKO

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.630
<i>Then you'll name
your daughter "Hanako," okay?</i>

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.430
<i>That's right. She's "Hana,"
so "Hanako" would be perfect!</i>

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.890
<i>Hanako! Hanako! Hanako!</i>

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.470
Giving 10,000 light years of ground
and leaving aside the fact for now

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.390
that it's playground talk,
I'm curious why they're so hot on

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:28.600
"Hanako" with the more graceful "Hana" than
"Hanako" with the more flamboyant "Hana."

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:28.600
HANAKO (Graceful Nuance)

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:28.600
HANAKO (Flamboyant Nuance)

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.270
Have you heard, Naga?

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.940
Those two are even talking
about having a kid already.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.230
Y-Yeah.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.610
Are you shocked?

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.570
I would say more like...

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.320
Higashi...

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.540
Higashi, you didn't notice!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.170
I'm not Naga. I'm Miri in disguise.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.300
I couldn't tell you were in disguise!

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:59.680
Miyakoshi, is your loveless relationship
with Higashida going well?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.930
Yeah, it's okay, since
I'm not making any real effort.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:05.810
And recently, my eyes
have been opened to kindness!

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.140
Kindness?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.770
When I have Higashida treat me
the day before payday

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:14.650
and he gets this really sourpuss look
on his face, I feel a little guilty about it!

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.230
What?

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.650
It doesn't mean anything if you feel
guilty but still make me treat you.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.570
In fact, that makes you even nastier.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:26.580
You waking up to the virtue of kindness...
It really is the 21st century.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.580
You got that right.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.540
I heard Adachi and Muranushi
are dating, too or something,

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.710
but aren't you going out
with anyone, Kamakura?

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.010
No, I'm not.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:39.550
Why not? There are
a lot of advantages to it.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.470
I see! You've already got money!

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.180
That's right! It's because
I've already got money!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.430
All right, my lady.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.680
Your shift is over.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.940
Y-You struck me, Saitou!
You just struck your employer!

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.770
Your father is my employer.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.570
It's the same thing! I'm your superior!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.780
Committing violence against
a higher-up or co-worker is a big deal!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.190
Getting fired doesn't
even begin to cover it!

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.200
You can fire me if you want,
but we're going home.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:06.410
She's got a point. Hitting or harming
your boss or co-workers is wrong.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.700
Miyakoshi, take a look in the mirror.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.710
Setting that aside, Kamakura
and the man in black sure do get along.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.290
That may be astute, coming from you.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:20.670
When Saitou is around,
Kamakura becomes very expressive.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.220
I know, right?

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:26.850
I want Shiho to grab her own happiness
instead of tormenting me.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:30.730
She and Saitou can become a couple,
have about three kids

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.310
and live as a happy family
in that needlessly huge house.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:38.150
And then I hope they go bankrupt
and the family breaks up!

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.070
What happened to her happiness?

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.400
<i>I'll reduce the amount of your debt.</i>

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:43.820
<i>By...</i>

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>By 500 yen.</i>

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.830
Get a hold of yourself, man!
Don't be fooled!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.540
That was just the whim of a demon,
a once in a century occurrence!

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:58.460
Wh-When you think about how
she's treated you, 500 yen is nothing!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.130
Stand your ground! I can survive for
a long time on 500 yen, but don't waver!

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.430
God of poverty, give me negative power!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:11.100
Give me negative power
so I won't have a mental breakdown!

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.100
Shindou, no worries on that score.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.560
You've been in the breakdown
stage for quite some time now.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:17.020
It's okay. I'm okay. I can still fight.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.940
All right, in order
to amplify my negative power,

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.780
I'll go over all of the torment
I've suffered. Dog food...

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.990
I can't let you see this.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.200
In the first place, why...

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:32.120
<i>If you and I get married,
that debt could be wiped out.</i>

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.080
<i>No, thanks.</i>

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:39.750
<i>I can't remember, why did I
blow her off like that again?</i>

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.840
<i>Oh, that's right. That one time...</i>

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:46.340
<i>Days before Shiho confessed
her feelings to me...</i>

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.680
<i>Yuuta, bye-bye!</i>

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.140
<i>She's really gotten attached to me.</i>

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.560
<i>Yuuta walked home with a girl again!</i>

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.860
<i>This is what's really annoying,
so I wish she wouldn't lay it on so thick.</i>

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.270
<i>That was the rich girl, Kamakura!</i>

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:05.490
<i>We're poor, but if he marries
a rich girl, we'll be rolling in dough!</i>

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:10.490
<i>Not to mention, dear old Dad's
debt will be forgiven, right?</i>

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.660
<i>- That sucks.
- I feel bad for Yuuta.</i>

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.830
<i>Get lost, you lousy excuse for a father!</i>

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.500
<i>Kids, let me borrow 500 yen.</i>

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.880
<i>Knock it off!</i>

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.710
<i>After all, I need to make money
from pachinko</i>

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.550
<i>to pay for your invalid mother's
medical expenses and living expenses.</i>

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:30.600
<i>Mom got sick after working too hard
because of your pachinko habit, dumbass!</i>

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:35.520
<i>Well, details aside, if you marry Shiho,
all our problems will be solved.</i>

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.180
<i>Wha...</i>

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.100
<i>It's not like you hate Shiho, right?</i>

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.480
<i>I don't hate anyone
more than you, Dad!</i>

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.150
<i>Then there you go!</i>

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.110
<i>Shiho is cute and above all...</i>

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.900
<i>...money is very important.</i>

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:51.780
<i>I'm painfully aware of how important
money is thanks to you!</i>

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.780
<i>Yuuta, that hurts.</i>

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:55.330
<i>That's what Dad said?</i>

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.580
<i>And then he went off
to play pachinko again.</i>

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:59.040
<i>Oh, that man...</i>

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.290
<i>He told me to have faith in the machine.</i>

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.380
<i>How can the man have faith in pachinko</i>

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:10.430
<i>after turning his friends and acquaintances
into guarantors and loan sharks?</i>

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.810
<i>I wish that good-for-nothing
would just blow away in the wind.</i>

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.770
<i>Although he's not a bad person at heart...</i>

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:18.730
<i>Dammit...</i>

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.100
<i>I won't be like my dad.</i>

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.570
<i>Yuuta, this grass is edible, too, isn't it?</i>

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:28.150
<i>Well, it does seem pretty clear
that she's got a crush on me.</i>

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.490
<i>It's annoying
when the other kids tease me,</i>

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:34.580
<i>but I have to admit, her looks
and personality are on the cute side.</i>

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.290
<i>Plus...</i>

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.750
RICH

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.330
<i>Are you okay, Yuuta?</i>

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:42.580
<i>Y-Yeah.</i>

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.630
<i>For just a second there,
I had a despicable idea.</i>

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:47.260
<i>Yuuta, um...</i>

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.680
<i>I hear your family owes
my dad a lot of money.</i>

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.720
<i>Apparently.</i>

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:55.180
<i>So, um... Uh...</i>

00:07:55.180 --> 00:08:01.190
THUMP THUMP

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:01.190
<i>If you and I get married,
that debt could be wiped out.</i>

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:07.230
<i>We're poor, but if he marries
a rich girl, we'll be rolling in dough!</i>

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.030
<i>Dear old Dad's debt will be forgiven, right?</i>

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.110
<i>No, thanks.</i>

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.450
<i>Don't get the wrong idea! Thinking
about it doesn't mean I wasn't sure!</i>

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.490
<i>I'm against it!</i>

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.460
<i>U-Um...</i>

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:23.210
<i>Sorry, but the other boys
are on my case about it,</i>

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:26.170
<i>so would you stop
following me around?</i>

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:28.460
<i>Shiho?</i>

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.920
<i>Why don't you treat me with respect?</i>

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.350
<i>You're in debt to me,
but you show no respect?</i>

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.470
<i>Stop stalking me.</i>

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.430
<i>Are you an imbecile? Know your place!</i>

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:44.900
<i>Pay me the respect I'm due!
Call me "Shiho-baby"!</i>

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.650
BABY

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.400
MS.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.650
<i>N-Not "Ms. Shiho"?</i>

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.500
Even though it's all
my damned old man's fault,

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.040
I regret that moment
to the core of my being.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.330
<i>You're poor? You're poor, right?</i>

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.550
<i>Why? Tell me why.</i>

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:13.010
I even regret feeling regret
over her subsequent transformation.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.470
She didn't have to change
that much, did she?

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:20.220
Kisaki, a strange person
has a chokehold on my life.

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.730
Is that right? Me, too.
That's exactly where I'm at right now.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:26.400
But good for you. Although half of it
is out of your control anyway,

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.520
not marrying for money proves
that you're not a brute. How admirable.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.150
I can't buy food by being admirable!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.450
Then tell her,
"I apologize for that one time.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:37.120
Marry me and please erase my debt."

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.160
Marry Shiho...

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.870
Money can't buy a person's emotions!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.870
How admirable. Can I go home?

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:49.790
I don't care if she has power over me.
I just wanna go back to that day.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.010
I see. And I wanna go back to my home.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:56.720
By the way, I've always been creeped out
by the cloying way you say her name.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:02.310
It seems Kamakura liked you better
back when you had an attitude,

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.020
so maybe her sadism would be curbed
if you didn't suck up so much.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.230
Not sucking up would have that effect?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.150
Kisaki...

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.740
There doesn't seem to be
any effect at all!

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:21.120
The difference is I have no feelings
for you, positive or otherwise.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.500
Then would you be happy if someone
you liked called you by your last name?

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.370
No.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:27.080
Then if you're just
mocking me, go home!

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:30.540
Jackass... Sorry for wasting
your time. I'm going home.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:36.050
Yeah, right, like not being so toadying
would make her less sadistic.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.090
Don't be too scared to find out.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:39.550
All right!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.720
Why are you so incompetent, Saitou?

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:45.140
You should notice it
when I've left something behind.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:48.190
How the hell would I know if you forgot
something in the women's locker room?

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:52.820
Shiho!

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:52.820
PRACTICING

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.950
There, you see. It didn't work.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:12.460
So that's what happened between
the blonde guy and the boss lady.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:16.260
Pretty much everyone who works here
knows about it, but never brings it up to her.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.380
That's why she kicked his ass
just for shouting her name.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.800
The young lady I know
is usually mild-mannered,

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.720
but he brings out
an utterly sadistic streak in her.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.140
A sadistic streak, huh?
If she does it knowing that he hates her,

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.520
I would argue that puts her
in the realm of masochism.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:35.030
How is it that you're only standoffish
when it comes to our lady?

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.400
If only she'd grown up
the way she was back then...

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:43.200
<i>A new man in black?
Please take good care of me!</i>

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:48.000
<i>Thank you for always working so hard,
Tasaka. I baked you some cookies.</i>

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.080
You know?

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.460
What?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.330
If she'd stayed like that growing up,

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.960
this would've all been
worked out peacefully. Dammit!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.960
So what's your point?

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:58.590
Ow!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:02.050
I have a headache. Aspirin...

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.800
Yes, I understand the reality. I'm sorry!

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:07.930
I don't know what you're talking about,
but I don't forgive you.

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:10.230
If you don't know, then forgive him.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:13.230
I'll get medicine myself.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.360
And I'm going to get a breath
of fresh air in the yard along the way.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.690
Don't follow me.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.740
Milady...

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:22.990
She really is dragged
down by old memories.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.240
Master Shindou...

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.620
If it's money you're after,
I'm totally broke!

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.040
I know.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.250
So what is it?

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:38.050
U-Um... Milady has been
feeling down lately...

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:41.720
To come straight to the point,
would you sit down and talk to her?

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:42.630
Wha...

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.970
After all, you are a host,
Master Shindou...

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.600
Why would I do that?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.680
Well, why don't we talk
after you've had breakfast?

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:56.310
Sorry, I have no idea what you're saying.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.860
Why don't you ask some other host?

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.070
Thank you for breakfast!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.200
Oh, come on...

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.280
For Milady, it has to be you,
Master Shindou.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:07.950
You understand, don't you?

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.790
If Milady continues
to be depressed like this,

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:18.500
her father will know that you are
the cause, and that we were no help.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:23.050
Um, I hesitate to spell it out, but...

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.630
...he'll kill us!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.800
<i>You spelled it out!</i>

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.760
Well, we'll give you
the particulars later on.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.100
And of course you'll get paid for it.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:32.350
I don't need it.

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:36.980
Poor or not, I won't accept cash
for fawning over Shiho.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.270
I don't need your money.

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:42.650
If it's a matter that concerns my own safety
as well as yours, that's enough.

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.910
Money can't solve everything!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:52.870
I-If you intended to lure me in
with that bun, I'll... pay you... for...

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:56.960
Um, the bun was left over
from my breakfast, so that doesn't count.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.460
If it was left over,
then it can't be helped.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:03.380
It's great working all day on Sunday!

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:07.390
Great for you, working on Sunday and not
having to spend any of your own money.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:08.430
Milady!

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.970
Tasaka, Saitou...
Where have you been all morning?

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:12.810
Oh, Yuuta...

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.390
Are you here directly
from the host club?

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:17.440
"Poor men have no leisure," huh?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.400
Is that any way to talk
to an old friend, Shiho?

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:22.900
<i>I wonder if Shindou has a death wish.</i>

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.400
<i>I wonder if Shindou has a death wish.</i>

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.530
<i>Does Shindou have a death wish?</i>

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.370
Yuuta, it sounds
like you have a death wish.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.330
My lady, there's a deep reason for that.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.080
No matter. Whether the reason
is deep or shallow, I won't forgive it.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.830
You beat the crap out of him yesterday
after he yelled your name, remember?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:42.880
That jarred his brain and his personality
has reverted to what it used to be.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.550
Wha...

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.880
Wh-What should I do?

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.590
I... I...

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:52.140
Do you think I'm stupid enough
to believe a lie like that?

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:56.390
Therefore, I'm going to chop him
in two, so fetch my sword.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.060
Forget it.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:01.560
<i>I've already wasted enough time being nice
to you, so you think I'll do what you say?</i>

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.940
<i>Nasty wench.</i>

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:03.980
Ridiculous.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:08.110
The idea that a shock could change
someone's personality has zero credibility.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.160
Don't you all agree?

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:16.870
Shock aside, if Shindou, despairing
of his life, ingested Miyakoshi's chocolate,

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:19.040
it's possible his personality
would disintegrate.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:23.710
It's possible a hungry Shindou
mistakenly ate that chocolate.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.050
He ate that chocolate?

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:29.340
<i>What kind of chocolate
could change someone's personality?</i>

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.890
Why don't we let him relax
in the break room for a while?

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:34.430
O-Okay.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.190
Come to think of it,
I haven't made chocolate recently!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.850
You just realized that now?

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:48.150
<i>I never would've thought that
Miyakoshi's chocolate would save my life.</i>

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.530
<i>When you sit down with her,
act like your old standoffish self.</i>

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.330
<i>I'm a host,</i>

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:58.580
<i>but all I really do is listen to the customers
gripe and have them buy me meals.</i>

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.790
<i>Acting standoffish would
probably infuriate Shiho.</i>

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.590
<i>What if she murders me?</i>

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.880
<i>Don't worry! We'll hide the evidence!</i>

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.670
<i>That's not what I'm worried about!</i>

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.220
<i>If anything happens, we'll rush in
to stop it, so don't worry.</i>

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:15.180
<i>But I think she'll be pleased,
so it'll be all right.</i>

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.810
<i>If she was pleased by that,
there'd be no need to go through all this.</i>

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.440
<i>What the hell? Let's do it!</i>

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:27.230
Shiho, I don't know why but you beat
the hell out of me just for yelling your name.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.070
After all, I...

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.780
<i>She really is pleased?</i>

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.660
<i>Jeez. This is dangerous,
but all I can do is trust the men in black.</i>

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.410
Shiho...

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.670
"After all" doesn't tell me anything!

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:46.920
<i>It seems like this is working!</i>

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:49.510
<i>But what kind of role-playing game is this?</i>

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.380
RUB RUB

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.380
<i>This is bad! I know
I'm going to pay for all of this later!</i>

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:55.600
<i>This situation... is making me
nervous. No, not nervous...</i>

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.640
<i>I'm excited!</i>

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:01.310
<i>But is this excitement
that kind of excitement?</i>

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:06.020
<i>The kind of excitement
that comes when your life is in danger?</i>

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.480
<i>I think I'll apologize
while I can still be saved.</i>

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.320
Shi...

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:17.530
Shiho, I don't get why mussing
your hair up a little makes you cry.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.160
Oh, but that's right.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.410
You used to be a crybaby
back in the day.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.080
The first time I met you, too...

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.290
<i>Wait, how far am I gonna
take this? Gotta back out!</i>

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.380
Sh-Shiho...

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.300
Sh-Shiho...

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:35.590
Y-Yuuta... Your old self...

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:40.520
B-Back then, you never
treated me like I was rich.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.230
That's the Yuuta I wanted
to be with, that's all,

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:47.810
b-but because of a stupid thing
I said, i-it all went wrong.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:54.110
You avoided me like everyone else
and c-came to hate me.

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:56.530
I would bully you, hoping
that would bring things back,

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:59.080
but it never has gone back
to the way things were.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.870
Well, how can I say this?

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:07.460
The second my dad incurred a debt from
your family, we couldn't be equals.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:15.260
So after I repay that debt, maybe we can
get back to the way we were.

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.970
U-Until then, be a good girl, Shiho...

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.100
Th-That's close...

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:20.930
...and wait for—

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.270
Going too far.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:23.770
Milady!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.600
Saitou, that was cruel!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:27.310
Swords hurt!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.980
You oughta be thankful.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.190
If I hadn't interceded then,
you'd be beyond help by now.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:34.030
I don't know what you were talking about,
but you were only supposed to talk.

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:36.360
You weren't supposed to make her cry
and then put the moves on her!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.990
Honestly, at first,
I meant to put on an act...

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.370
An act?

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.490
But it became real in the second half!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.370
Becoming real is where you went wrong!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.710
Milady?

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.870
Either way, you wanna get us all killed?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:49.750
W-Wait, if it wasn't
M-Miyakoshi's chocolate or an act...

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.130
M-Milady, calm down!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.840
Saitou, it looks
like Milady is over the blues,

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.670
but something seems wrong, so let's go!

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:56.380
Right.

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.220
Master Shindou,
about what happens going forth...

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:03.770
One. Under the yoke of a heavy debt,
you work yourself into an early grave.

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:08.270
Two. Our boss, her father, becomes furious
about what happened and has you killed.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:11.690
Three. You make another pass at her
and end up dead.

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:15.150
Four. You don't do anything,
she gets offended and you end up dead.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.490
And so on. There are various patterns,
so live strong and prosper.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.200
Good luck.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.200
But I die in all of the patterns!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.410
A FEW DAYS LATER

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.210
I'm alive...

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:34.590
For now, it seems like
there's no blowback from Shiho's father.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.430
<i>But the only thing
I can see in my future is death!</i>

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:43.050
<i>Still, that evening, Shiho was pretty cu—</i>

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:50.900
SHAKE SHAKE

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.020
H-Hurry up and pay back that money.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.690
<i>I want to pay it back
as soon as possible...</i>

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:50.900
<i>for several reasons!</i>

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:53.730
That was scary.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.570
She's become even more
aggressive than before.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:01.410
<i>Well, I have a feeling she's in a bad mood
because I'm not saying her name.</i>

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.280
<i>Maybe.</i>

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:05.080
<i>But if I speak casually to her,
Shiho's dad will probably kill me.</i>

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.660
<i>If I suck up to her,
she'll probably kill me!</i>

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:11.290
<i>How is it that the tone I take
with her is so tied in to death?</i>

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.880
<i>It's all because of that debt. The debt.</i>

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:19.090
<i>It would be so much easier
if I had an unexpected windfall.</i>

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:22.720
It's bad for my daughter's upbringing,
so take your muttering somewhere else.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.390
The debt is really your father's,
but he disappeared, right?

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:28.560
Wouldn't it be faster to search for him?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.770
Easier said than done.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:33.060
My old man has a talent for disappearing.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:37.900
That may be, but on the other hand,
he may be nearer than you think.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.150
Like you, he could be
grazing in a grassy area.

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:42.200
Wha... P-Please don't mock me!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:47.160
I've already covered all of the grassy
areas around here for sustenance!

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.410
I'm sorry.

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:23.170
Jeez...

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.470
There's no way I'll be able to find
my old man so easily.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:28.680
There he is.

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:29.800
Die!

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:34.310
I wanted to see you, Dad.

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:35.520
Sorry!

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:37.850
How many years
have you been on the run now?

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:40.400
Not on the run.
I've been waiting for the right time.

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.280
Have you won Shiho's heart yet?

00:22:45.490 --> 00:22:46.360
Dad...

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:50.580
Even after being on the lam,
your way of thinking hasn't changed at all!

00:22:52.330 --> 00:22:57.710
If you and Shiho get together,
she'll be happy, you'll have a wife,

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:00.710
and for the sake of his daughter's
happiness, the father will be like,

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:04.420
"Oh, what the hell?" and erase my debt.
How marvelous! Everyone is happy.

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:07.590
You deserve to be unhappy!

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:09.010
Jeez.

00:23:09.010 --> 00:23:11.810
Be a drifter
for the rest of your life, you bum.

00:23:11.810 --> 00:23:13.100
I'm done with you.

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:20.400
Mom is worried about you!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:23.400
Get your ass home, you stupid old man!

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:35.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:29.950
And so, Yanagiba,
I've always wondered about that...

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:31.410
It's my shut-in aura.

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:32.160
Next time,

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:35.950
"If Someone Hits You on the Right Cheek,
Counter With Your Left Fist."

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:35.950
IF SOMEONE HITS YOU ON THE RIGHT CHEEK,
COUNTER WITH YOUR LEFT FIST
